<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 91-day T-bill yield rises to 10.21 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 91-day T-bill yield rises to 10.21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average rate on 91-day Lithuanian Treasury bills leapt at auction on Tuesday, hitting 10.21 percent after 9.77 percent on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   LAST TIME   MIN/MAX   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p>  91-day     10.21	 9.77     9.58/10.90  50    64.291  50</p>
<p>The settlement date for today's auction is December 13 and the bills mature on March 14.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
